  "answer": "To help users anticipate a car's actions in novel traffic situations, it has been proposed that end-users develop a good mental model or understanding of the robot's objective function (https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.03465). The mechanism for achieving this involves showing users maximally informative examples of the autonomous car's behavior, which guides them toward an implicit understanding of the trade-offs the car's objective function makes between different features, such as safety and efficiency (https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.03465)."
